<title>USA: Tekonsha CSD, Mich., won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Tekonsha CSD, Mich., won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $1.5 million of Teko nsha Community Schools, Mich., general obligation 1996 school building and site bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.51 percent.</p>
</text>
